# asap7.layermap - map layer GDS -> Virtuoso cho strmin (mo top_soc.gds)
#
# BAN DU PHONG.  PDK asap7_pdk_r1p7 da co san ban CHINH THUC, uu tien dung:
#   $PDK_DIR/cdslib/asap7_TechLib_10/asap7_TechLib.layermap
# File nay chep dung ten layer/purpose cua ban do (kiem 2026-10-01 voi
# asap7_TechLib_08.layermap tren GitHub) - chi dung khi khong tim thay PDK.
#
# KHONG dung asap7_fromAPR.layermap cho strmin: do la map cua Innovus
# (streamOut -mapFile, cu phap 'M1 NET 19 0'), khong phai map cua Virtuoso.
#
# Ten layer PHAN BIET hoa/thuong va khac ten trong calibreDRC.rul: well, fin,
# Gate, GCut, Active, Nselect, Pselect, Dummy (ban truoc 2026-10-01 ghi WELL,
# FIN, GATE... nen strmin bo het FEOL).
#
# top_soc.gds (soc_write_gds_map): moi hinh kim loai/via/fill o datatype 0,
# ten chan o texttype 251 -> purpose 'pin'.  Pad (96/0, chi co metal fill)
# khong co trong ban chinh thuc -> strmin bao 96/0 khong map va bo qua, vo hai.
#
# <layerName> <purpose> <gdsNumber> <gdsDataType>

# ---- FEOL (chi co trong GDS std cell, LEF khong mang) ----
well       drawing    1     0
fin        drawing    2     0
Gate       drawing    7     0
Dummy      drawing    8     0
GCut       drawing    10    0
Active     drawing    11    0
Nselect    drawing    12    0
Pselect    drawing    13    0
LIG        drawing    16    0
LISD       drawing    17    0
SDT        drawing    88    0
SLVT       drawing    97    0
LVT        drawing    98    0
SRAMDRC    drawing    99    0
SRAMVT     drawing    110   0

# ---- BEOL ----
V0         drawing    18    0
M1         drawing    19    0
