V6         drawing    65    0
M7         drawing    70    0
V7         drawing    75    0
M8         drawing    80    0
V8         drawing    85    0
M9         drawing    90    0
V9         drawing    95    0

# ---- Ten chan (texttype 251) ----
well       pin        1     251
P_SUB      pin        3     251
Gate       pin        7     251
LIG        pin        16    251
LISD       pin        17    251
M1         pin        19    251
